20 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>01. What are Muzzle Sleeping Strips?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-21_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-22_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-23_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:2.5px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-24_"><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-25_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-37ff3b21-6876-4657-8b2f-76ca1307578e"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Muzzle Sleeping Strips are a gentle, doctor-recommended solution designed to reduce snoring by promoting nasal breathing. They are made with our Breathe-Safe™ Technology and are free from harmful chemicals like BPA, phthalates, parabens, and PFAS. These strips are available in various designs for adults and children to help improve sleep quality.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-28_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-29_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="68767657-4b2f-46ca-9307-578e282006ef" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>02. How do Muzzle Strips work?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-31_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-32_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-33_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:2.5px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-34_"><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-35_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-76ca1307-578e-4820-86ef-49eb8dc67dbc"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">The strips work by encouraging nasal breathing, which helps to reduce snoring caused by mouth breathing. </span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-38_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-39_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="578e2820-06ef-49eb-8dc6-7dbcab53636b" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>03. Are the strips safe to use?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-41_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-42_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-43_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:2.5px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-44_"><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-45_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-49eb8dc6-7dbc-4b53-a36b-b870cf27613a"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Yes! Muzzle Sleeping Strips are made with hypoallergenic materials that are safe for sensitive skin. Our strips are also free from harmful chemicals such as BPA, phthalates, parabens, and PFAS, making them a safe choice for both adults and children.
</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-48_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-49_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="7dbcab53-636b-4870-8f27-613ab68d848d" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>04. How do I apply the strips?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-51_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-52_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-53_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:2.5px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-54_"><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-55_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-b870cf27-613a-468d-848d-baf60c6dde9b"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Applying the strips is simple. Just peel off the backing and apply to skin. Gently press it in place to ensure it adheres securely. It’s that easy! The strips will stay in place all night without discomfort.
</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-58_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-59_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="613ab68d-848d-4af6-8c6d-de9ba3a29e03" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>05. Can Muzzle Sleeping Strips stop snoring completely?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-61_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-62_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-63_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:2.5px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-64_"><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-65_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-baf60c6d-de9b-43a2-9e03-6a1ca0d82a04"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">While Muzzle Sleeping Strips can significantly reduce snoring by promoting nasal breathing, the effectiveness may vary from person to person. For many, the strips provide a noticeable improvement, leading to quieter, more restful sleep. We recommend using the strips consistently for the best results.
</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-68_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-69_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="de9ba3a2-9e03-4a1c-a0d8-2a043a083332" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>06. Can I use the strips if I have allergies or sensitive skin?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-71_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-72_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-73_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:2.5px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-74_"><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-75_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-6a1ca0d8-2a04-4a08-b332-2ddc1b8fc11b"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Absolutely! Muzzle Sleeping Strips are designed with sensitive skin in mind. The strips are hypoallergenic, and the breathable adhesive minimizes irritation, making them suitable for most users, even those with allergies or sensitive skin.
</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-78_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-79_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="073280c3-9711-4927-821f-45a195d0b6f4" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>07. How long will the strips stay on?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-dxcExB boHSLB pf-81_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-ijaoyg fLgXwO pf-82_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-83_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:2.5px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-84_"><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-85_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-5927021f-45a1-45d0-b6f4-077c756c0717"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">The strips are designed to stay securely in place throughout the night. Thanks to the strong yet comfortable adhesion, they won’t come off while you sleep.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-kRRxPL iQTArD pf-88_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-kqGpvY cmTzNW pf-89_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="07174053-4b20-498c-ac44-9167e7e51f57" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns